   separation (a FACT, not the verdict): the two arms' sample ranges OVERLAP
   verdict: NULL RESULT, which is a result
            NULL on the magnitude: the two arms are 1.03x apart on the MEDIAN per-round ratio,
            short of the 4.82x it has to beat (the larger of: per-round swing 4.82x,
            run-to-run scatter NOT MEASURED on this host). Decided by measure_util.hpp's
            difference-against-spread rule, in FACTORS because a percentage of it
            depends on which arm is the denominator; range separation is not what
